rted out now![\/p][p]I've put a lot of time into making this game, from the different abilities and game modes to all the little secrets hidden throughout the store. I'm really excited for everyone to finally get to play it![\/p][p]Since this is my first game, I'd genuinely love to hear what you all think. If you run into any bugs, have suggestions, or think there's something I could improve, please let me know in the discussions![\/p][p]Thank you to everyone who wishlisted the game, followed its development, or decided to give it a try. I really appreciate the support, and I hope you enjoy sorting some dumplings! \u2764\ufe0f[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1426387032_1793240445_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"567049673541548749","event_gid":"706661261982564895","voteupcount":5,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"567049673541548749","rtime32_last_modified":1793416920,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793240445,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793240338,"votes_up":5,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"564796840407529053","gidfeature2":"567049673541548749"},{"gid":"742688880388473533","clan_steamid":"103582791476031795","event_name":"Sort the Dumplings \u2014 A Fresh Look Before Launch!","event_type":28,"appid":5356930,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792202100,"rtime32_end_time":1792205700,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"New visuals, adorable dumplings, and exciting improvements ahead of our October 28 launch!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Sort the Dumplings is getting ready for launch! Check out our improved environments, polished gameplay, and adorable themed dumplings ahead of October 28.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"d8256a892ad78063d628c6f3722dc73d7365e0ca.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"6e6a854819f49a62cc65add5bc63dbc87022f2f3.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"742688880388473534","clanid":"46510387","posterid":"0","headline":"Sort the Dumplings \u2014 A Fresh Look Before Launch!","posttime":1792202137,"updatetime":1792202137,"body":"[h1]Sort the Dumplings \u2014 A Fresh Look Before Launch! [\/h1][p]We're getting closer to the launch of [b]Sort the Dumplings[\/b], and we've been hard at work making the game better than ever![\/p][p]We've been polishing the environments, improving the visuals, and adding finishing touches to make sorting dumplings as satisfying as possible.[\/p][p]Here's what you can look forward to:[\/p][list][*][p]Tons of adorable themed dumplings to discover[\/p][\/*][*][p]Three ways to play: Normal, Timed, and Abilities[\/p][\/*][*][p]Colorful environments and satisfying sorting gameplay[\/p][\/*][*][p]Hidden golden dumplings to find[\/p][\/*][*][p]Plenty of surprises along the way![\/p][\/*][\/list][p]We've also been working on an updated gameplay trailer and new screenshots to show off the improvements.[\/p][p][b]Sort the Dumplings launches October 28 on Steam![\/b][\/p][p]If you haven't already, add the game to your wishlist so you don't miss the release.[\/p][p]Thank you for all the support so far and over 500 wishlists![\/p]","commentcount":2,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1434573178_1792202377_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"564796840407529054","event_gid":"742688880388473533","voteupcount":2,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"564796840407529054","rtime32_last_modified":1792775529,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792202378,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792202118,"votes_up":2,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"564796840407529053","gidfeature2":"564796840407529054"},{"gid":"706661261982568075","clan_steamid":"103582791476031795","event_name":"Update 1.0.4 \u2013 Pick Your Save, Better Cloud Saves & More","event_type":12,"appid":5356930,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793724971,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"[]","announcement_body":{"gid":"706661261982568076","clanid":"46510387","posterid":"0","headline":"Update 1.0.4 \u2013 Pick Your Save, Better Cloud Saves & More","posttime":1793724971,"updatetime":1793724971,"body":"[b]Save slots per mode[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]Each mode (Normal, Power-Ups and Challenge) now has its own save. Starting a New Game only replaces the save for that mode, so your other runs are safe.\n[*]If you have more than one saved run, Continue now asks which one you want, showing how many dumplings you've sorted and your time played.\n[*]This also fixes the Steam Cloud issue where playing different modes on two devices (like PC and Steam Deck) made one of your saves seem to disappear.\n[\/list]\n\n[b]Abilities bench[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]Normal mode now shows the new Abilities popup too, with a note that abilities are available in Power-Ups and Challenge. You can still preview what each ability does.\n[\/list]\n\n[b]Little touches[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]A \"Light Switch\" label now sits above a certain light switch...\n[*]Fixed some missing collision on the rooftops in the Pirates scenery outside the windows.\n[*]The version number on the main menu now shows the current version (1.0.4).\n[\/list]\n\nThanks for playing, and for all the feedback!","commentcount":0,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1691520782_1793725843_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"567050270269270020","event_gid":"706661261982568075","voteupcount":2,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"567050270269270020","rtime32_last_modified":1793742358,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793725843,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793724971,"votes_up":2,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"564796840407529053","gidfeature2":"567050270269270020"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["706661261982564896","742688880388473534"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1793724971,"event_gid":"706661261982568075","announcement_gid":"706661261982568076","clan_account_id":46510387}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Sort The Dumplings is a satisfying sorting game about turning complete chaos into perfectly organized shelves.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A massive pile of dumplings has taken over the store, and every one of them has a home. Dig through the mess, find matching dumplings, and return them to the correct shelves one by one.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >With <strong>190 unique dumplings across 19 themed collections</strong>, there is always something new hiding in the pile. Sort everything from food and ocean creatures to space explorers, fantasy characters, prehistoric creatures, weather, jobs, music, and more.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >SORT THE CHAOS</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Search through a huge pile of dumplings and figure out where every one belongs. Pick them up, carry them through the store, and place them into their matching shelf sections.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >COMPLETE YOUR COLLECTIONS</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Each shelf contains its own themed collection. Fill every section to complete the category and watch your empty store slowly transform into a colorful wall of perfectly organized dumplings.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >WATCH THE WORLD CHANGE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Completing categories doesn't just change the shelves. The world outside the store can transform to match the collection you've finished, creating new scenes to discover as you progress.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Choose between multiple ways to sort:</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> — Relax and sort the store at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Timed Mode</strong> — Race against the clock and see how quickly you can finish.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Abilities Mode</strong> — Use special abilities and upgrades to tackle the chaos in a completely different way.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >FIND THEM ALL</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Discover dozens of wildly different dumpling designs, hunt for hidden golden dumplings, complete every shelf, and see if you can turn the entire store from an overwhelming mess into dumpling paradise.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whether you're here to relax, collect every dumpling, or chase a faster completion time, there's always another dumpling waiting to be sorted.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Generative AI tools were used to assist in creating some pre-generated 3D models, textures, visual assets, and promotional artwork. All content is generated before gameplay, reviewed by the developer, and integrated into the finished game. No generative AI is used live during gameplay.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
